 "remarks": "It's all here, in the heart of downtown Stamford! This sparkling one-bedroom unit is located in The Biltmore, a community known for its luxury amenities, including a 24-hour concierge, fitness center, and short distance to Metro-North. Beautifully maintained, this sunny unit features hardwood floors and an in-unit washer/dryer. The spacious living/dining area overlooks a pretty courtyard, while the kitchen and full bath have been nicely updated. Parking garage space available for $118 per month. Freshly painted, this welcoming, turn key home is ready for immediate occupancy!",
